The release PRIVATE key is not in the repository and must never be committed (.gitignore ignores
*.key and *.pem). It lives on the jouleWise build machine, by default at
~/.tenderos-release/release.key (or wherever RELEASE_KEY points when running build-bundle.sh).

The matching PUBLIC key is deploy/enterprise/release.pub; it ships in every bundle and is what
the client's tenderos-patch verifies signatures with. How to generate a pair, rotate it and tell
the client its fingerprint: deploy/enterprise/README.md, "The release keypair".
